227 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( 20% of the total KSC token supply is dedicated to validator and staking incentives, which are essential for bootstrapping and maintaining network security from day one. Because KSC has a fixed, non-inflationary supply, this allocation acts as a pre-funded reward pool for validators. Instead of minting new tokens, block rewards are paid from this pool or from transaction fees. The incentive pool is designed to cover multiple years of rewards, giving the network time to grow until transaction fees alone can sustainably compensate validators. Tokens in this category are locked in a smart contract and released on a scheduled basis, ensuring continuous and predictable compensation for securing the chain.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 88 0 R
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [11]
