>>
endobj
230 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (KSC will launch with a set of trusted institutional validators, including major Kazakhstani banks, telecom companies, and universities. These partners provide the necessary technical capacity and public trust to bootstrap the network. Early validators may receive an initial delegation of KSC tokens from this pool to begin operation, but these grants come with strict lock-up conditions to prevent immediate resale. Participation from these respected institutions signals strong confidence in the network's security and integrates KSC into the national economic infrastructure. The allocation is carefully managed to prevent centralization, ensuring no single entity controls a majority of staked tokens and that power is earned through ongoing participation.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
