233 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This allocation ensures validators are fairly compensated from the very beginning, securing the chain before it generates significant fee income. By pre-allocating rewards instead of inflating the token supply, KSC protects existing holders from dilution, aligning with Kazakhstan's focus on monetary stability. Partnering with established institutions builds vital public trust and encourages broader adoption by embedding the network within the professional ecosystem. Ultimately, validators are incentivized to maintain high performance, as their long-term earnings are directly tied to the network's growth and health.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
