<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The flagship initiative is an "Independence Day Airdrop" coinciding with KSC's launch on December 16, 2025. Every verified Kazakhstani citizen can claim a modest amount of KSC tokens \(e.g., ~50 KSC\) for free. Distribution will leverage the country's robust digital ID systems \(eGov portal\) for secure, one-per-person verification. This approach immediately creates a critical mass of users, invites exploration of the blockchain's features, and aligns with national digital inclusion goals.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
